msgctxt "168"
msgid "Man... I am so bored right now. Isn't there anything fun we can do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Well, there's nothing on TV⑬and I checked all the channels. I must have read"
" my manga a thousand times, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Hey, I know! Let's make up a game! C'mon, it'll be fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Hey, kids. What are you three up to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Nothing! That's the problem. We're practically dying of boredom, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Oh yeah? I can think of plenty for you to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"But you're just gonna make us do chores, Uncle Kaz! Even doing nothing is "
"better than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "What about your homework, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "We already finished it⑬every last page!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Ooh, ooh! I got it! Why don't we go play hide-and-seek? And Uncle Kaz can be"
" it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Hmm... Now that's something I haven't played in ages..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Sure, why not? It's good for you kids to play outside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Yesss! With Uncle Kaz hot on our trail, this'll be the best game of hide-"
"and-seek ever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Ooh, I'll go get Eri-chan, too! We can all play together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "It sure has been a while... And it might be nice to go outside, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Oh, and by the way, Uncle Kaz. Izumi'll start crying if you find her too "
"quick, so try to save her for last, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Got it. It's nice of you to look out for her like that, Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Haha, well I'm basically the big brother around here! Gotta make sure "
"everyone's happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Okay, Eri-chan's here! Is anyone else coming?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Nope. I couldn't find Haruka-chan, and everyone else is busy cooking or "
"something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Hey, Izumi-chan? Can we... hide together?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Not this time. Uncle Kaz would spot us in a millisecond!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"Okay everyone, you're allowed to hide inside and in the front yard! Uncle "
"Kaz here will kindly count to ten while we all hide! Everyone got it? "
"Then... On your marks... Get set... GO!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"One... two... three... four... five... six... seven...\r\n"
"eight... nine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Ten! Ready or not, here I come!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Once you find one of the kids, press <Action:Button_R3@Adventure> to switch to a\r\n"
"first-person perspective. Make your presence known by\r\n"
"looking directly at them. Leave no child left behind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"But if you want to call it quits, simply walk\r\n"
"out of Morning Glory's front gate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Sorry, maybe next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Boo! You're no fun, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Ugh, now we really have nothing to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Come play with us if you ever have time, Uncle Kaz! It'll be fun, promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "All right, I'll see if I can make some time for you guys later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Hey, Uncle Kaz! You ready to play hide-and-seek!?"
